RCID**\\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277\\n\\n**Additional notes or concerns**\\n\\n\",\n\n\n/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__pr_result__/src/ontology/imports/merged_import.owl:\n  Line 148991: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:CNA\") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:DAN\") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000003263> \"A collagen alpha chain that is a translation product of the human COL1A1 or COL1A2 genes, 1:1 orthologs thereof, or a semi-ortholog thereof.\")\n\n  Line 149000: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:CNA\") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000003264> \"A collagen type I alpha chain that is a translation product of the human COL1A1 gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof.\")\n\n  Line 149001: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:DNx\") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pr#PRO-short-label>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000003264> \"COL1A1\")\n\n  Line 151046: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:DNx\") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pr#PRO-short-label>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000018798> \"COL1A1/ClvPrd\")\n\n  Line 153215: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:DNx\") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pr#PRO-short-label>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#h